#: ../../tools/scientific_calculator_tools.rst:32
#: 78cf37abed8f418b816a3b3f40894c52
msgid ""
"**Description**: Translate a DNA sequence to protein in all 3 forward "
"reading frames and identify the longest ORF. Uses the standard genetic "
"code (NCBI Code 1). Returns protein sequences for each frame, longest ORF"
" per frame, and the best frame with longest uninterrupted protein. Use "
"for: reading frame analysis, finding the correct ORF in an unknown "
"sequence, comparing all three frames."
msgstr ""

